Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:10.23,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.23,0:00:12.51,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.87,0:01:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The star fell, Bull. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That is no ordinary star.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.43,0:02:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the tear of a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What is a warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.89,0:02:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,One who has finished his battle\Nsomewhere on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A pitiful soul that could not\Nbelieve in the Great Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.11,0:02:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The report from Callisto went\Ndirectly to Sir Vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.11,0:02:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He is requesting a deal for Red-Eye. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,30,000 Woolongs per gram.\NA total of 7500 grams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.72,0:03:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he specify you as the dealer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a Titan veteran.\NWe were in the same unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.49,0:03:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does he rely on you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Callisto is undergoing a depression right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can't see the future, he is sure to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.71,0:03:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All the more reason to keep\Nour hands out of that moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.62,0:03:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Vicious, are you not\Nthe one that is worrying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no permission to\Nmake your own decisions. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless of who it is, those who go\Nagainst the Van's will are punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You believe that I would\Nbetray my own mentor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.99,0:03:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mao's case was merely bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin... You shall go with Vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. {snap to start keyframe?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Long!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Callisto is a frigid planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.85,0:03:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Take plenty of winter clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, no cold climate is\Nworth taking precautions for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:04:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It is true that the planet\Nis warmer than your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your heart is colder than a snake's skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A snake cannot eat a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be fine by myself. {9 frames basically}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to survive,\Nyou must betray me at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.57,0:04:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, never.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That would go against the Van's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Such old-fashioned thinking\Nmakes me nauseous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Those damn corpses!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I will protect you,\Nfor the honor of the Red Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Honor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, it's up to me to slaughter them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.16,0:05:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What a depressing bunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this humidity?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so muggy that I can't sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just a breakdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be hard for me to do\Nif I saw your faces,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm leaving without seeing you one\Nlast time. Please don't look for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.39,0:05:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That wench...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She sucked out all the\Nantifreeze from the radiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be out for at least half a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she didn't pull this stunt\Nwe wouldn't look for her. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,She emptied out the safe as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.43,0:06:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,7, 8, 9... hello! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.95,0:06:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really looking for Faye?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.48,0:06:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,1, 0, 1, 1, goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you just wasting time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.73,0:06:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything else to do right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.83,0:06:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You found her?! {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.67,0:06:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lessee... code name...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.50,0:06:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Julia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is that coming from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Lessee...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.29,0:06:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Blue Crow on Callisto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's it going to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.05,0:06:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It got disconnected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.19,0:06:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, there are no girls in Blue Crow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.69,0:06:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:06:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.84,0:07:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a common woman's name!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Faye? {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.09,0:07:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a lawless area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman surely can't survive\Nwandering about all alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.91,0:07:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling sympathetic?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty of sympathy...\Nfor the money she ran away with!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.23,0:07:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna look for my woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can look for that other woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have nothing to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.72,0:07:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. We only go so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.51,0:07:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you come back,\Nthere won't be a place for you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:07:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't do anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.37,0:08:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're not as lonely now\Nthat you have more strange roommates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You stayed here just for that reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.81,0:08:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.91,0:08:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been three years\Nsince I teamed up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But I never knew you looked at me that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was under the impression\Nthat {\i1}you{\i0} were the lonely one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we cleared that up. {original: "Well we got rid of that misunderstanding."}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good riddance! Now we'll\Nhave more money for food!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I never did understand you,\Neven to the very end!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.11,0:10:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know any woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I would know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a rumor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no luck with 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather be with an armadillo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you heard of the name Julia?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You shoulda said so earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one in front of\NTony's place every night!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! I'm not Julia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ju-li-us! I'm Julius!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.23,0:10:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're my type. Wanna\Nhang out with me tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.43,0:10:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I already have plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.87,0:10:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Gren might know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen him with a woman before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gren?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.13,0:10:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like this is it for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a customer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.14,0:10:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even. Can't you tell he's straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's switch locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.23,0:10:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who and where is Gren?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.20,0:10:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So you wanna hang out\Nwith me tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a sax player in Blue Crow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,When someone sneezes\Nand doesn't get told to take care,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,that person becomes a fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.37,0:11:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what they say around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.81,0:11:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already a fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not as easy as I appear to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I am not interested in women. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.82,0:11:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But the others seem to be highly interested. {lead-out decreased by 1 frame}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't know that there\Nwere no women in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.59,0:12:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll be very popular...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You should watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm searching for something...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.12,0:12:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.14,0:12:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The only things are stale bread,\Na broken-down car, and rancid booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a guy named Gren. {9 frames, almost 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.15,0:12:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Vicious, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.07,0:13:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the money? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.40,0:13:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If ya don't put out,\Nit won't do ya any good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.75,0:13:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is annoying...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.69,0:13:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So annoying it's repulsive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell am I Vicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.05,0:14:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-There was info that there was\Ngonna be some deal for Red-Eye. {added the hesitation}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.71,0:14:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,From Gren to Vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought of taking that cash...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I look like I got money?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.61,0:14:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Foreigners are all rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And the code name was Julia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh... Sure sounds like\Nsome easy wench's name!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme a Cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no bounties around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.33,0:14:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bourbon with milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.75,0:14:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, {\i1}that{\i0} Cowboy. I knew that.\NYou can't possibly be a bounty-hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, who's our customer today?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Grencia Mars Elijah Guo Eckener.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:14:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's a long name!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:15:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah. He escaped from\Nmilitary prison 3 years ago{\i0} {original: "three"}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and the statute of limitations\Nis about to expire.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that means?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The bounty is double!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is a chance you can't miss!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I kinda feel like we can let him go...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.11,0:15:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Judy, what are you saying?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.38,0:15:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's an escaped convict!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.39,0:15:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But Punch...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's very handsome!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.77,0:15:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just look at his picture!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lessee... Oh, come on...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.68,0:15:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm much more handsome than he is.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.77,0:15:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Punch, I just can't laugh at that joke...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you turn that thing off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.81,0:15:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.87,0:15:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. That guy\Npassed out over there is a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.28,0:15:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What do ya wanna say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, there's a bounty on my head, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is a hideout for people like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.19,0:15:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.01,0:15:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? {2 frames extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.83,0:16:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to get rid of all this\Nfrustration, and nobody's coming? {lead-out decreased by 1 frame}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... you're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss, your appearance is\Nrather harmful to the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.33,0:16:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you enticing us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.50,0:16:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.33,0:16:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't do this, I'll chip a nail...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, any time now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You wench! {lead-out decreased by 1 frame}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.84,0:16:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.61,0:17:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.85,0:17:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you said you're a fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come with me? {13 frame link}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.63,0:17:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cuz I got no place to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can trust me that easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you weren't\Ninterested in women.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.49,0:17:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I might take your money and kill you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.47,0:17:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lived longer than I seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to such a slummy\Nneighborhood all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.57,0:17:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want comrades,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.60,0:17:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's not worth having any.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I end up worrying about\Nthings I don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.53,0:18:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, 'cuz I'm such a good woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.22,0:18:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All the guys end up fighting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They often say that humans can't live alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.77,0:18:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can live pretty long by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.93,0:18:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of feeling alone in a group,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.32,0:18:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,it's better to be alone in your solitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm dealing with them,\Nit's nothing but trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't get squat out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So it doesn't matter if I'm there or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.94,0:18:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You just got scared of losing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.70,0:18:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So you distanced yourself from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.84,0:18:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.25,0:18:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why I'm\Ntalking to you about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.73,0:19:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm in a confessional.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.51,0:19:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever had\Nexperience as a minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.24,0:19:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.23,0:19:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to take a shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.01,0:19:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where peeping toms might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't peek, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, I can't guarantee that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gren... You're not there?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Vicious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.17,0:20:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm out with 'honroutou'.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Along with the 'mangan' and the{\i0}\N{\i1}'ura-dora; it's 32000. I'll be waiting.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.85,0:20:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you dating Julia behind my back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.01,0:20:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotten pretty big.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.63,0:20:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He used to work under you,\Nbut things are different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.66,0:21:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for her. Having her name\Nused for some crooked deal like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You were always the one\Nleaving others out of the loop. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.03,0:21:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We still haven't settled\Nthe score from earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.26,0:21:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.23,0:21:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way, Lin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.36,0:21:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Julia was here, in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.22,0:21:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, out of the way, Lin! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.63,0:21:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Which are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.75,0:22:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I am both, but I am neither.
