Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.44,0:23:54.15,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.44,0:23:54.15,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.59,0:24:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... How are men and women different?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.72,0:24:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... I think women are hiding\Nmore vital things than men are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.31,0:24:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... but there are women\Nthat aren't feminine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.55,0:24:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And there are men\Nthat aren't masculine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.36,0:24:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What about those that\Naren't normally feminine,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.71,0:24:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but show that side on\Nsome chance circumstance?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.28,0:24:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.31,0:24:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.03,0:24:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.42,0:24:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.36,0:24:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.87,0:24:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Jupiter Jazz, part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.37,0:24:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's me.
